codex
One important scope detail: riscv-dv’s `--no_fence=1` excludes the whole SYNCH category, including `FENCE_I`, because that category also carries unsupported fence forms. I’m leaving that existing exclusion in place and documenting it as generator scope rather than pretending it was covered by this run.
